flowchart LR
    A[Incoming prompt] --> P[P worker: loops before cut]
    P --> E[Producer CUDA event]
    E --> T[NIXL: valid KV and all prompt states]
    T --> I[D worker: verified import]
    I --> Q[Continuation rows at cut depth]
    D[Existing decode rows at other depths] --> M[Native Mixed row gather]
    Q --> M
    M --> G[Shared physical projections]
    G --> K[Per-request and per-depth attention metadata]
    K --> S[Scatter states to original owners]
    S --> C[Full fixed-depth completion and sampling]

    Q --> O[A_sep: separate phase execution]
    D --> O

    X[Unimplemented conditional admission] -. before cut .-> P
